## Changelog

```mdl
decision D-1: Claude Code (cloud) always runs with a Claude subscription OAuth token; an Anthropic API key is never lent to it.
  date: 2026-10-20
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-9.2]
```

```mdl
decision D-2: An OAuth token stored under the Anthropic source is still lent, and a space holding only an API key lends no Claude credential and logs a warning. Fills in [D-1].
  date: 2026-10-20
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-9.2]
  why: The token's kind, not where it is stored, decides what it costs; a subscription token pasted into the Anthropic connector is still a subscription token.
  rejected:
    - Fail the turn when only an API key is connected: the agent already reports a missing credential when Claude Code starts without one.
```

```mdl
decision D-3: The local coding-agent runtime lives in this plugin, not plugin-code: the agent entry, the `AgentHelper` host interface, the agent server and worktrees, the project's code folder, and a Tauri-only module that runs the server as the `dx-agent` sidecar. Any `AgentHelper` makes the agent available, so plugin-dev-shell can host it in a Vite dev server.
  date: 2026-10-21
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [AgentHelper]
  why: Only Claude Code uses the runtime, and plugin-code is the plugin-authoring workbench; a dev server should run the same agent without the desktop app.
  rejected:
    - The host interface in plugin-assistant or a shared types package: the runtime is Claude-specific, so dev-shell depends on this plugin instead.
```

```mdl
decision D-4: A chat's agent, where it runs and its model are chosen in one picker in the prompt, which replaces the chat's options popover; Claude Code and Claude Code (cloud) are one agent that runs on this device or on EDGE.
  date: 2026-10-21
  by: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-9.1]
```

```mdl
decision D-5: QA-4 and QA-5 describe the agent picker and the "Assign to Claude Code (EDGE)" task action, and are unverified until their flows run again. Fills in [D-4].
  date: 2026-10-21
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-9.1, QA-4, QA-5]
  why: The steps used the removed options popover and the old "(cloud)" label of the task action.
```

```mdl
decision D-6: Claude Code gets the chat's MCP connections, the same servers a chat run by Composer's own agent connects.
  date: 2026-10-22
  by: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-8.5]
```

```mdl
decision D-7: A connection with no credential is offered to Claude Code by its URL; one with a credential is served through the agent helper's relay, where the page adds the credential to each request, and the agent presents the session's Composer token. A credentialed server that streams over SSE is not offered, since the relay answers with whole bodies. A changed set of servers reloads the session; a refreshed credential does not. Fills in [D-6].
  date: 2026-10-22
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-8.5]
  why: Claude Code's MCP config travels on its command line, which any user on the machine can read, and an agent takes its MCP servers only when a session opens or reloads.
  rejected:
    - Put the credential in the server's headers: it would be readable on the command line.
    - Give each credential its own environment variable: the helper passes the agent one token, and a credential refreshed mid-session would still be stale.
```

```mdl
decision D-8: A chat on Claude Code chooses its model, effort and permission mode in the agent picker, beside the agent and where it runs; a chat that chooses none runs Claude Code's default model and effort and the plugin's permission setting.
  date: 2026-10-26
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-9.5, QA-6]
  why: The auto mode's classifier refuses too much for some work, and a chat should not need the global setting changed to run differently.
```

```mdl
decision D-9: The EDGE sandbox runs the agent in the first repository it checked out, with the others as additional directories whose CLAUDE.md it reads, and reports the mode, model and effort the agent says it runs with. Fills in [D-8].
  date: 2026-10-26
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-9.3, F-9.5]
  why: Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md, skills and settings from its working directory and the directories above it, never below, so an agent started in the checkout root saw none of the repositories' instructions; and Claude Code falls back from a mode it cannot run without failing the request.
  rejected:
    - A CLAUDE.md in the checkout root that imports each repository's: it brings in neither skills nor settings.
```

